documents are ruled. An unruled table reads as a\n     layout accident rather than a schedule of items. */\n  table.doc-table th, table.doc-table td {\n    border: 1px solid #000;\n    padding: 4pt 6pt;\n    font-size: 10.5pt;\n  }\n  table.doc-table th { background: #eee; text-align: center; }\n  /* A signature block split across a page break is the single most common\n     complaint about generated documents. */\n  .signature-block, .sig, tr { page-break-inside: avoid; }\n  img { max-width: 100%; }\nbody { font-family: Georgia, \'Times New Roman\', serif; }</style>\n</head><body>\n<div style=\"border:3px double #1a3a5c; padding:28pt; text-align:center; height:100%\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:11pt; letter-spacing:2px\">REPUBLIC OF THE PHILIPPINES</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:14pt; font-weight:bold; text-transform:uppercase; margin-top:2pt\">Municipality of Roxas, Oriental Mindoro</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:9.5pt\">Municipal Hall Compound, Poblacion, Roxas, Oriental Mindoro</div>\n\n  <div style=\"font-size:26pt; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:3px; margin:26pt 0 4pt\">CERTIFICATE OF RECOGNITION</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:11pt\">is hereby awarded to</div>\n\n  <div style=\"font-size:24pt; font-weight:bold; margin:14pt 0 2pt; text-transform:uppercase\">Juan D. Reyes</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:11pt; font-style:italic\">Observer</div>\n\n  <div style=\"font-size:12pt; margin:18pt 40pt 0; line-height:1.7\">in recognition of their invaluable contribution and outstanding support to <strong>Public Bid Opening</strong> held on March 15, 2026.</div>\n\n  <div style=\"margin-top:14pt; font-size:11pt\">Given this 11th day of August 2026 at Municipality of Roxas, Oriental Mindoro.</div>\n\n  <div style=\"margin-top:34pt; display:inline-block; text-align:center\">\n    <div style=\"font-weight:bold; text-transform:uppercase; border-top:1px solid #000; padding-top:4pt; min-width:260pt\">Hon. Teresita M. Alcantara</div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Municipal Mayor</div>\n  </div>\n</div></body></html>','{\"lgu_name\": \"Municipality of Roxas, Oriental Mindoro\", \"occasion\": \"Public Bid Opening\", \"document_no\": \"COR-2026-0001\", \"lgu_address\": \"Municipal Hall Compound, Poblacion, Roxas, Oriental Mindoro\", \"office_name\": \"BAC Secretariat\", \"current_date\": \"August 11, 2026\", \"current_year\": \"2026\", \"occasion_date\": \"March 15, 2026\", \"official_name\": \"BAC Secretariat\", \"recipient_name\": \"Juan D. Reyes\", \"recipient_role\": \"Observer\", \"signatory_name\": \"Hon. Teresita M. Alcantara\", \"current_date_long\": \"11th day of August 2026\", \"official_position\": \"BAC Secretariat\", \"signatory_position\": \"Municipal Mayor\"}',0,'void',NULL,'2026-08-11 14:29:41','Name misspelled on the original.',0,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-08-11 14:29:41','2026-08-11 14:29:41',6,6,NULL,21,NULL,NULL,21,NULL),(4,'ITB-2026-0001','invitationToBid','ITB-2026-001 â€” Supply and Delivery of Medical Equipment for the Municipal Health Office','rfq',4,'<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><title>ITB-2026-001 â€” Supply and Delivery of Medical Equipment for the Municipal Health Office</title>\n<style>\n  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    /* Explicit white. With printBackground on, a transparent body inherits\n       whatever is behind it â€” fine on paper, wrong everywhere the same HTML is\n       previewed, including a dark-themed browser. (No backticks in here: this\n       block lives inside a template literal.) */\n    background: #ffffff;\n    font-family: \"Times New Roman\", Times, serif;\n    font-size: 12pt;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    color: #000;\n  }\n  h1, h2, h3, h4 { margin: 0 0 8pt; line-height: 1.25; }\n  p { margin: 0 0 8pt; }\n  table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; }\n  /* Tables in official documents are ruled. An unruled table reads as a\n     layout accident rather than a schedule of items. */\n  table.doc-table th, table.doc-table td {\n    border: 1px solid #000;\n    padding: 4pt 6pt;\n    font-size: 10.5pt;\n  }\n  table.doc-table th { background: #eee; text-align: center; }\n  /* A signature block split across a page break is the single most common\n     complaint about generated documents. */\n  .signature-block, .sig, tr { page-break-inside: avoid; }\n  img { max-width: 100%; }\n</style>\n</head><body>\n<div style=\"text-align:center; margin-bottom:18pt\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:10.5pt\">Republic of the Philippines</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12pt; font-weight:bold; text-transform:uppercase\">Municipality of Roxas, Oriental Mindoro</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:10pt\">Municipal Hall Compound, Poblacion, Roxas, Oriental Mindoro</div>\n  <hr style=\"border:0; border-top:1.5px solid #000; margin-top:8pt\" />\n</div>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center; margin:8pt 0 2pt; letter-spacing:1px\">INVITATION TO BID</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center; margin-bottom:4pt\">for</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold; text-transform:uppercase; margin-bottom:14pt\">Supply and Delivery of Medical Equipment for the Municipal Health Office</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center; margin-bottom:16pt\">ITB-2026-001</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">1. The <strong>Municipality of Roxas, Oriental Mindoro</strong>, through its approved budget for the current fiscal year,\nintends to apply the sum of <strong>TWO MILLION EIGHT HUNDRED FIFTY THOUSAND PESOS AND 00/100 (â‚±2,850,000.00)</strong> being the Approved Budget for the Contract (ABC)\nto payments under the contract for <strong>Supply and Delivery of Medical Equipment for the Municipal Health Office</strong>. Bids received in excess of the ABC shall be\nautomatically rejected at bid opening.</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">2. The Municipality of Roxas, Oriental Mindoro now invites bids for the above procurement. Delivery or completion\nshall be within the period stated in the bidding documents. Bidders should have completed a contract similar to the\nproject. The description of an eligible bidder is contained in the bidding documents.</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">3. Bidding will be conducted through open competitive bidding procedures using a\nnon-discretionary pass/fail criterion, in accordance with <strong>Republic Act No. 12009</strong>, the New Government\nProcurement Act, and its Implementing Rules and Regulations. This procurement is undertaken through\n<strong>Competitive Bidding</strong> pursuant to IRR Sec. 26.</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">4. Interested bidders may obtain further information and inspect the bidding documents\nat the address below during office hours.</p>\n\n<h3 style=\"margin-top:14pt; font-size:12pt\">5. Schedule of activities</h3>\n<table class=\"doc-table\">\n  <tr><th style=\"width:45%\">Activity</th><th>Date and time</th></tr>\n  <tr><td>Advertisement / posting</td><td>March 3, 2026</td></tr>\n  <tr><td>Pre-bid conference</td><td>Not applicable</td></tr>\n  <tr><td>Deadline for submission of bids</td><td>March 24, 2026</td></tr>\n  <tr><td>Opening of bids</td><td>March 24, 2026</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify; margin-top:12pt\">6. A bid security in the form and amount prescribed by the IRR is required. Bids must be duly received by the BAC Secretariat\non or before the deadline stated above. Late bids shall not be accepted.</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">7. The Municipality of Roxas, Oriental Mindoro reserves the right to reject any and all bids, declare a failure of\nbidding, or not award the contract at any time prior to contract award, without thereby incurring any liability to the\naffected bidder or bidders.</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">8. For further information, please refer to the BAC Secretariat, BAC Secretariat,\nMunicipal Hall Compound, Poblacion, Roxas, Oriental Mindoro.</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top:16pt\">Issued this August 11, 2026.</p>\n\n<div class=\"signature-block\" style=\"margin-top:42pt\">\n  <div>Very truly yours,</div>\n  <div style=\"margin-top:36pt; font-weight:bold; text-transform:uppercase\">Hon. Teresita M. Alcantara</div>\n  <div>Municipal Mayor</div>\n</div></body></html>','{\"abc\": \"â‚±2,850,000.00\", \"lgu_name\": \"Municipality of Roxas, Oriental Mindoro\", \"issued_on\": \"August 11, 2026\", \"pr_number\": \"PR-2026-0001\", \"document_no\": \"ITB-2026-0001\", \"lgu_address\": \"Municipal Hall Compound, Poblacion, Roxas, Oriental Mindoro\", \"office_name\": \"BAC Secretariat\", \"prebid_date\": \"Not applicable\", \"abc_in_words\": \"TWO MILLION EIGHT HUNDRED FIFTY THOUSAND PESOS AND 00/100\", \"current_date\": \"August 12, 2026\", \"current_year\": \"2026\", \"publish_date\": \"March 3, 2026\", \"official_name\": \"BAC Secretariat\", \"project_title\": \"Supply and Delivery of Medical Equipment for the Municipal Health Office\", \"signatory_name\": \"Hon. Teresita M. Alcantara\", \"bid_opening_date\": \"March 24, 2026\", \"procurement_mode\": \"Competitive Bidding\", \"bid_security_note\": \"A bid security in the form and amount prescribed by the IRR is required.\", \"current_date_long\": \"12th day of August 2026\", \"official_position\": \"BAC Secretariat\", \"signatory_position\": \"Municipal Mayor\", \"implementing_office\": \"Municipal Health Office\", \"submission_deadline\": \"March 24, 2026\", \"procurement_category\": \"goods\", \"procurement_mode_citation\": \"IRR Sec. 26\", \"procurement_reference_number\": \"ITB-2026-001\"}',0,'draft',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-08-12 03:17:11','2026-08-12 03:17:11',9,13,NULL,21,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL);
